flowchart TD
  C["MCP client"] -->|"request, no token"| RS["Resource server"]
  RS -->|"401 + metadata URL (RFC 9728)"| AS["Client reads the authorization<br/>server metadata, verifies the issuer"]
  AS --> REG{{"How is the client known?"}}
  REG -->|"preferred"| CIMD["Client ID Metadata Document"]
  REG -->|"fallback"| DCR["Dynamic Client Registration"]
  CIMD --> PK["Authorization code + PKCE<br/>with a resource indicator"]
  DCR --> PK
  PK --> TK["Token bound to this resource,<br/>step-up when more scope is needed"]
